# Differences from CSS system color keywords, which resolve to the desktop's
# own theme and reach no font decision.
#
#                 linux              windows
#     LinkText    rgb(0, 0, 238)     rgb(0, 102, 204)
#     ButtonFace  rgb(239, 239, 239) rgb(240, 240, 240)
#
# text-decoration-color strokes its last line with LinkText.
# word-spacing-large-value draws a <button>, whose face is ButtonFace.
